{"id":1428,"root":"جبن","bw":"jbn","tr":"j-b-n","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبُنَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاب</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبنن</span> </span>, (S, Msb, K,) aor. <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبُنَ</span> </span>, inf. n. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْنٌ</span> (Msb, K) and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبُنٌ</span> (K) and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبَانَةٌ</span>; (Msb, K;) and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبَنَ</span>, (S, ISd, Msb,) aor. <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبُنَ</span> </span>; (Msb, TA;) <em>He</em> (a man) <em>was,</em> or <em>became, such as is termed</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبَان</span> (S, Msb, K) and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبِين</span>; (S, K;) i. e. <em>cowardly,</em> (K,) or <em>weak hearted.</em> (Msb.) And <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبُنَ عَنْهُ</span> <em>He held back,</em> or <em>refrained, from him,</em> or <em>it, through cowardice.</em> (TA in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عرس</span>.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبَنهُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاب</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبنه</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبننه</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبنة</span> </span>, inf. n. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَجْبِينٌ</span>, <em>He attributed to him cowardice</em> (<span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْن</span>). (S.) And <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هُوَ يُجَبَّنُ</span>, inf. n. as above, <em>He is accused of cowardice.</em> (K.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجبنهُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجاب</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجبن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجبنه</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجبنة</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجبنه</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجبنة</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبن</span> </span> <em>He found him to be such as is termed</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبَان</span>; (S, Msb, K;) i. e. <em>a coward,</em> or <em>cowardly,</em> (K,) or <em>weak-hearted:</em> (Msb:) or <em>he reckoned him a coward;</em> (M, K;) as also ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتبنهُ</span>. (K.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجبّن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أجاب</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاب</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجبن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجبنن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجب</span> </span> <em>It</em> (milk) <em>became like</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْن</span> [i. e. <em>cheese</em>]. (K.) ― -b2- And hence, perhaps, (TA,) (assumed tropical:) <em>He</em> (a man) <em>became thick, gross, coarse,</em> or <em>big.</em> (S, TA.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتبنهُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتبنه</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتبنة</span> </span> <em>He made cheese of it;</em> i. e. of milk. (T, K.) -A2- See also 4. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْنٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاب</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبنن</span> </span> and ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبُنٌ</span> and ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبُنٌّ</span>, (S, Msb, K,) the first of which is the most approved, and the last the most rare, and said by some to be used only in a case of necessity in poetry, (Lth, Msb,) [<em>Cheese;</em>] <em>a certain thing that is eaten,</em> (S, Msb,) <em>well known:</em> (K:) n. un. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْنَةٌ</span>, (TA,) a word having a more particular signification than <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْنٌ</span>, (S,) meaning <em>a</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُرص</span> [or <em>round, flattened, loaf</em>] <em>thereof,</em> (Mgh,) [or <em>a cheese,</em> or <em>piece of cheese,</em>] as also <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبُنَةٌ</span> (TA) and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبُنَّةٌ</span>. (S, TA.) -A2- Also <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْنٌ</span> and ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبُنٌ</span>, [inf. ns. of <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبُنَ</span>, used as simple substs.,] <em>Cowardice; weak-heartedness;</em>] the <em>quality denoted by</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جَبَانٌ</span>. (S.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبُنٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاب</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبنن</span> </span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْنٌ</span>, in two places. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبُنٌّ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاب</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبنن</span> </span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْنٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْنِىٌّ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جب</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبن</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبنى</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جبني</span> </span> <em>A seller of</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُبْن</span> [i. e. <em>cheese</em>]. (TA.) ― -b2- And a rel. n. from <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُوقُ الجُبْنِ</span> [<em>The cheesemarket</em>] in Damascus. (K.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":4171,"entries":9,"shownEntries":9,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"jbn"}